    <title>C 语言学习笔记 · 第二天</title>
    <link href="/2026/11/06/c-language-day2/"/>
    <url>/2026/11/06/c-language-day2/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="C-语言学习笔记-·-第二天"><a href="#C-语言学习笔记-·-第二天" class="headerlink" title="C 语言学习笔记 · 第二天"></a>C 语言学习笔记 · 第二天</h1><p>第一天学会了变量、输入输出和循环，今天按计划往前推进：<strong>数组、函数</strong>，最后用一个小游戏把学到的东西串起来。</p><h2 id="一、数组：一次存一串数据"><a href="#一、数组：一次存一串数据" class="headerlink" title="一、数组：一次存一串数据"></a>一、数组：一次存一串数据</h2><p>第一天用变量存一个数，如果有 5 个学生的成绩呢？定义 5 个变量太笨了，这时候就用数组。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> scores[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] = &#123;<span class="hljs-number">90</span>, <span class="hljs-number">85</span>, <span class="hljs-number">77</span>, <span class="hljs-number">92</span>, <span class="hljs-number">68</span>&#125;;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; <span class="hljs-number">5</span>; i++) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;第 %d 个学生成绩：%d\n&quot;</span>, i + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, scores[i]);<br>    &#125;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>几个关键点：</p><ul><li><code>int scores[5]</code> 表示「能装 5 个整数」的数组</li><li>访问元素用 <code>scores[0]</code>、<code>scores[1]</code>……<strong>下标从 0 开始</strong></li><li>最后一个元素是 <code>scores[4]</code>，不是 <code>scores[5]</code></li></ul><table><thead><tr><th>元素</th><th>下标</th><th>值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>第 1 个</td><td><code>[0]</code></td><td>90</td></tr><tr><td>第 2 个</td><td><code>[1]</code></td><td>85</td></tr><tr><td>第 5 个</td><td><code>[4]</code></td><td>68</td></tr></tbody></table><p>⚠️ <strong>今天第一个坑</strong>：数组下标从 0 开始。5 个元素的数组，合法下标是 0~4。写 <code>scores[5]</code> 不会报错，但读到的是内存里的垃圾数据，甚至可能让程序崩溃——这种错误最难查。</p><h2 id="二、遍历和求和：数组最常用的套路"><a href="#二、遍历和求和：数组最常用的套路" class="headerlink" title="二、遍历和求和：数组最常用的套路"></a>二、遍历和求和：数组最常用的套路</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> scores[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] = &#123;<span class="hljs-number">90</span>, <span class="hljs-number">85</span>, <span class="hljs-number">77</span>, <span class="hljs-number">92</span>, <span class="hljs-number">68</span>&#125;;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> sum = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; <span class="hljs-number">5</span>; i++) &#123;<br>        sum += scores[i];<br>    &#125;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;总分：%d\n&quot;</span>, sum);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;平均分：%.1f\n&quot;</span>, sum / <span class="hljs-number">5.0</span>);    <span class="hljs-comment">// 记得用 5.0 而不是 5</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个「for 循环 + 下标」的模式，几乎能解决所有数组问题：求和、找最大值、统计个数都靠它。</p><p>找最大值的写法值得单独记一下：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> max = scores[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>];              <span class="hljs-comment">// 先假设第一个最大</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>; i &lt; <span class="hljs-number">5</span>; i++) &#123;     <span class="hljs-comment">// 从第二个开始比</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (scores[i] &gt; max) &#123;<br>        max = scores[i];<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="三、函数：把代码打包"><a href="#三、函数：把代码打包" class="headerlink" title="三、函数：把代码打包"></a>三、函数：把代码打包</h2><p>写多了会发现很多代码在重复。函数就是「给一段代码起个名字，以后叫名字就执行它」。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 定义一个函数：算两个数的和</span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">add</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> a + b;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> result = add(<span class="hljs-number">3</span>, <span class="hljs-number">5</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;3 + 5 = %d\n&quot;</span>, result);    <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出 8</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>拆开看函数的结构：</p><table><thead><tr><th>部分</th><th>例子</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>返回类型</td><td><code>int</code></td><td>函数算完返回什么类型，不返回就写 <code>void</code></td></tr><tr><td>函数名</td><td><code>add</code></td><td>调用时用的名字</td></tr><tr><td>参数</td><td><code>(int a, int b)</code></td><td>外面传进来的数据</td></tr><tr><td>函数体</td><td><code>&#123; return a + b; &#125;</code></td><td>具体做什么</td></tr><tr><td>返回值</td><td><code>return</code></td><td>把结果交回去</td></tr></tbody></table><p>没有返回值的函数：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">say_hello</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">char</span> name[])</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;你好，%s！\n&quot;</span>, name);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 调用</span><br>say_hello(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;小明&quot;</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>⚠️ <strong>第二个坑</strong>：C 语言里函数<strong>必须先声明或定义，再使用</strong>。如果 <code>add</code> 写在 <code>main</code> 后面，编译器会警告「隐式声明」。解决办法是把它写前面，或者在开头写个声明：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">add</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b)</span>;    <span class="hljs-comment">// 提前声明一下，函数体可以放后面</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="四、变量作用域：函数里的变量外面看不见"><a href="#四、变量作用域：函数里的变量外面看不见" class="headerlink" title="四、变量作用域：函数里的变量外面看不见"></a>四、变量作用域：函数里的变量外面看不见</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>;          <span class="hljs-comment">// main 里的变量</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (a &gt; <span class="hljs-number">5</span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b = <span class="hljs-number">20</span>;      <span class="hljs-comment">// b 只在这个大括号里活着</span><br>    &#125;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// printf(&quot;%d&quot;, b);  // ❌ 这里访问不到 b，会报错</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>简单记：<strong>变量从定义它的那行开始，到它所在的大括号结束为止有效</strong>。所以函数的局部变量不会互相干扰，这也是函数好用的原因之一。</p><h2 id="五、实战：猜数字小游戏"><a href="#五、实战：猜数字小游戏" class="headerlink" title="五、实战：猜数字小游戏"></a>五、实战：猜数字小游戏</h2><p>把今天和第一天学的都用上——循环、判断、函数、随机数。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;time.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    srand(time(<span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>));              <span class="hljs-comment">// 用当前时间当随机种子</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> answer = rand() % <span class="hljs-number">100</span> + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;  <span class="hljs-comment">// 生成 1~100 的随机数</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> guess;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> count = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;我想了一个 1~100 的数字，你猜猜看！\n&quot;</span>);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (<span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;请输入你的猜测：&quot;</span>);<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, &amp;guess);<br>        count++;<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (guess &gt; answer) &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;大了！\n&quot;</span>);<br>        &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (guess &lt; answer) &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;小了！\n&quot;</span>);<br>        &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;猜对了！你用了 %d 次。\n&quot;</span>, count);<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;                   <span class="hljs-comment">// 猜对就跳出循环</span><br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>两个新东西：</p><ul><li><code>rand()</code> 生成随机数，但直接用它每次结果都一样，必须先用 <code>srand(time(NULL))</code> 播种</li><li><code>rand() % 100 + 1</code> 是固定套路：<code>% 100</code> 得到 0<del>99，再加 1 就是 1</del>100</li></ul><p><code>while (1)</code> 是「一直循环」的写法，配合 <code>break</code> 在合适的时候跳出来——这个组合很常用。</p><h2 id="六、今天的坑"><a href="#六、今天的坑" class="headerlink" title="六、今天的坑"></a>六、今天的坑</h2><ol><li><strong>数组下标从 0 开始</strong>，<code>int a[5]</code> 的合法下标是 0~4，越界不报错但结果乱掉</li><li><strong>函数要先定义或声明再使用</strong>，否则编译警告</li><li><strong><code>rand()</code> 不播种每次结果都一样</strong>，记得 <code>srand(time(NULL))</code></li><li><strong>用 <code>&amp;</code> 读入数组元素</strong>：<code>scanf(&quot;%d&quot;, &amp;scores[i]);</code>，漏了就崩</li></ol><h2 id="七、小结"><a href="#七、小结" class="headerlink" title="七、小结"></a>七、小结</h2><p>今天学会的：</p><ol><li>数组一次存多个同类型数据，靠「for + 下标」遍历</li><li>函数把重复逻辑打包，参数传进去、<code>return</code> 交结果</li><li>变量有作用域，出了大括号就失效</li><li>用循环 + 判断 + 随机数，做出了第一个能玩的小程序</li></ol><h2 id="八、明天计划"><a href="#八、明天计划" class="headerlink" title="八、明天计划"></a>八、明天计划</h2><ul><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 学字符串，处理文字而不只是数字</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 学指针——听说这是 C 语言最难也最核心的部分</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 把猜数字游戏加上「最多猜 7 次」的限制</li></ul><p>写完猜数字游戏跑起来的那一刻，比 Hello World 有意思多了 🎮</p>]]></content>
    
    
