  <entry>
    <title>C 语言学习笔记 · 第一天</title>
    <link href="/2026/11/05/c-language-day1/"/>
    <url>/2026/11/05/c-language-day1/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="C-语言学习笔记-·-第一天"><a href="#C-语言学习笔记-·-第一天" class="headerlink" title="C 语言学习笔记 · 第一天"></a>C 语言学习笔记 · 第一天</h1><p>今天正式开始学 C 语言。这篇文章记录第一天的收获，包括第一个程序、变量、输入输出和一些容易踩的坑。写给同样刚起步的自己，也写给以后回头看时的我。</p><h2 id="一、第一个程序：Hello-World"><a href="#一、第一个程序：Hello-World" class="headerlink" title="一、第一个程序：Hello World"></a>一、第一个程序：Hello World</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, World!\n&quot;</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>逐行拆解：</p><table><thead><tr><th>代码</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</code></td><td>引入标准输入输出库，<code>printf</code> 就住在这里</td></tr><tr><td><code>int main(void)</code></td><td>程序入口，每个 C 程序都从这里开始执行</td></tr><tr><td><code>printf(&quot;...&quot;)</code></td><td>把内容打印到屏幕上</td></tr><tr><td><code>\n</code></td><td>换行符，不写的话下次输出会挤在同一行</td></tr><tr><td><code>return 0;</code></td><td>告诉系统「程序正常结束」</td></tr></tbody></table><p>编译运行（用 gcc）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">gcc hello.c -o hello<br>./hello<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>💡 <strong>笔记</strong>：C 语言是编译型语言，写完的 <code>.c</code> 文件必须先用编译器「翻译」成可执行文件，电脑才认。</p></blockquote><h2 id="二、变量与数据类型"><a href="#二、变量与数据类型" class="headerlink" title="二、变量与数据类型"></a>二、变量与数据类型</h2><p>C 语言是<strong>强类型</strong>语言：用变量前必须先声明类型，而且类型定下来就不能随便改。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> age = <span class="hljs-number">18</span>;            <span class="hljs-comment">// 整数</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">float</span> height = <span class="hljs-number">1.75f</span>;    <span class="hljs-comment">// 小数（单精度）</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">double</span> weight = <span class="hljs-number">62.5</span>;    <span class="hljs-comment">// 小数（双精度，更精确）</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> grade = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;A&#x27;</span>;        <span class="hljs-comment">// 单个字符，用单引号</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;年龄：%d\n&quot;</span>, age);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;身高：%.2f 米\n&quot;</span>, height);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;体重：%.1f 公斤\n&quot;</span>, weight);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;等级：%c\n&quot;</span>, grade);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>常用类型和占位符对照：</p><table><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>含义</th><th>占位符</th><th>例子</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>int</code></td><td>整数</td><td><code>%d</code></td><td><code>int a = 10;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>float</code></td><td>单精度小数</td><td><code>%f</code></td><td><code>float f = 3.14f;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>double</code></td><td>双精度小数</td><td><code>%lf</code> &#x2F; <code>%f</code></td><td><code>double d = 3.14159;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>char</code></td><td>单个字符</td><td><code>%c</code></td><td><code>char c = &#39;x&#39;;</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p>⚠️ <strong>踩坑记录</strong>：<code>char</code> 用<strong>单引号</strong> <code>&#39;A&#39;</code>，双引号 <code>&quot;A&quot;</code> 是字符串，两者完全不同。我第一次就写错了，编译报错一堆。</p><h2 id="三、输入：scanf"><a href="#三、输入：scanf" class="headerlink" title="三、输入：scanf"></a>三、输入：scanf</h2><p>有了变量，就能让用户自己输入数据：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> num;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;请输入一个整数：&quot;</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, &amp;num);          <span class="hljs-comment">// 注意 &amp; 符号！</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;你输入的是：%d\n&quot;</span>, num);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>⚠️ <strong>今天最大的坑</strong>：<code>scanf</code> 里的变量**必须加 <code>&amp;</code>**（取地址符）。不加的话程序可能直接崩溃。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, &amp;num);   <span class="hljs-comment">// ✅ 正确</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, num);    <span class="hljs-comment">// ❌ 错误，会崩溃</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>记忆方法：<code>scanf</code> 要「把数据放进这个地址」，所以得告诉它变量住在哪；<code>printf</code> 只是「读出值」，不需要地址。</p><h2 id="四、运算符"><a href="#四、运算符" class="headerlink" title="四、运算符"></a>四、运算符</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>, b = <span class="hljs-number">3</span>;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a + b);   <span class="hljs-comment">// 13  加</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a - b);   <span class="hljs-comment">// 7   减</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a * b);   <span class="hljs-comment">// 30  乘</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a / b);   <span class="hljs-comment">// 3   除（整数除法，小数部分直接丢掉！）</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a % b);   <span class="hljs-comment">// 1   取余</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>⚠️ <strong>重点坑</strong>：两个整数相除，结果还是整数。<code>10 / 3</code> 得到 <code>3</code> 而不是 <code>3.33</code>。想要小数结果，至少一边得是小数：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%f\n&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10</span> / <span class="hljs-number">3.0</span>);   <span class="hljs-comment">// 3.333333</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>还有 <code>++</code> 和 <code>--</code>：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">5</span>;<br>i++;        <span class="hljs-comment">// i 变成 6</span><br>i--;        <span class="hljs-comment">// i 回到 5</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="五、条件判断：if-else"><a href="#五、条件判断：if-else" class="headerlink" title="五、条件判断：if &#x2F; else"></a>五、条件判断：if &#x2F; else</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> score;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;请输入分数：&quot;</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, &amp;score);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (score &gt;= <span class="hljs-number">90</span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;优秀\n&quot;</span>);<br>    &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (score &gt;= <span class="hljs-number">60</span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;及格\n&quot;</span>);<br>    &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;不及格，继续加油\n&quot;</span>);<br>    &#125;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>⚠️ <strong>坑</strong>：判断相等用 <code>==</code>（两个等号），<code>=</code> 是赋值。<code>if (a = 5)</code> 不会报错，但逻辑全错，这个错误特别隐蔽。</p><h2 id="六、循环：for-和-while"><a href="#六、循环：for-和-while" class="headerlink" title="六、循环：for 和 while"></a>六、循环：for 和 while</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-comment">// for 循环：知道要循环几次时用它</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>; i &lt;= <span class="hljs-number">5</span>; i++) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;第 %d 次循环\n&quot;</span>, i);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// while 循环：满足条件就一直循环</span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> n = <span class="hljs-number">3</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (n &gt; <span class="hljs-number">0</span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;倒计时 %d\n&quot;</span>, n);<br>    n--;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>for</code> 的三个部分：<strong>初始化；条件；每轮结束后做什么</strong>。我把它记成「从哪开始、到哪停、每次走几步」。</p><h2 id="七、第一天小结"><a href="#七、第一天小结" class="headerlink" title="七、第一天小结"></a>七、第一天小结</h2><p>今天学到的核心概念：</p><ol><li>C 程序必须编译才能运行，入口是 <code>main</code> 函数</li><li>变量要先声明类型，常见的有 <code>int</code>、<code>float</code>、<code>double</code>、<code>char</code></li><li><code>printf</code> 输出用占位符，<code>scanf</code> 输入记得加 <code>&amp;</code></li><li>整数除法会丢小数，判断相等用 <code>==</code> 不是 <code>=</code></li><li>分支用 <code>if/else</code>，循环用 <code>for</code>&#x2F;<code>while</code></li></ol><h2 id="八、明天计划"><a href="#八、明天计划" class="headerlink" title="八、明天计划"></a>八、明天计划</h2><ul><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 学数组，试着存一串数字</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 学函数，把重复代码抽出来</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 手写一个「猜数字」小游戏练手</li></ul><p>第一天结束，代码虽然简单，但能跑起来的那一刻真的挺爽的 🎉</p>]]></content>
    
    
